There are very few scrolls that are more useful when cursed, so I am of
the opinon that blessed is (usually) better than uncursed for magic
markers because there aren't many instances [1] where uncursed is
better than blessed.

It is usually more resource-efficient to (un)curse a single marker than
b/u/c (as needed) scrolls to fit ones desired final b/u/c status.

When I can wish for (or have) multiple magic markers, I prefer 1
desecrated (cursed) and the rest blessed.  When I have (or can wish
for) only one, I prefer it uncursed (for many of) the same reasons you
do.

